                    rdfs:subClassOf :Molecular_Modeling_and_Classification ;
                    desc:definition "Resource that provides access to software, applications, or toolkits that involves atoms and molecules are allowed to interact for a period of time by approximations of known physics." ;
                    rdfs:label "Molecular Dynamics" .


