                                       desc:definition "Resource that provides access to software, applications, or toolkits that calculate the time course of biomolecular configurations and their classification." ;
                                       rdfs:label "Molecular Modeling and Classification" ;
                                       skos:editorialNote "pending final vetting: review definition" .


